('20ft-container-office-2-offices-plus-washroom-restroom','20FT Container Office (2 offices plus Washroom/restroom)','Container','Container offices, modular office','Nyahururu',null,2,null,'Customer was looking for a modular offices made from 1 by 20ft container. Firmcop converted this 20ft into a modern 2 offices plus a rest room in 2 weeks.',array['https://razgnrakpthcdfwihamo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/gallery-images/1788288139516-mdr9y8ddmc.webp','https://razgnrakpthcdfwihamo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/gallery-images/1788288141371-d5i9ikmnhla.webp','https://razgnrakpthcdfwihamo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/gallery-images/1788288142526-i490h0d11gj.webp','https://razgnrakpthcdfwihamo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/gallery-images/1788288143590-9orfea6wed.webp','https://razgnrakpthcdfwihamo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/gallery-images/1788288144531-fodkzouucob.webp','https://razgnrakpthcdfwihamo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/gallery-images/1788288145413-5pol1rixwfq.webp']::text[],true,true,1),
